{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52318f915dbdbbe9eec64a6f77cdf85a74e5daed88807a4a80b9b5218f40dffd",
      "text": "“怎样才能向喜欢的人告白？”\n这边是……“最近比起他，更沉迷于工作了”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccea2c3c516293349eead66e46ac8f672b0bacca833c399bdfd8968d95ae959d",
      "text": "即使同是恋爱的烦恼……也有各种各样的形式呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d1e50a1d38282301d3270b5949dc22d190bbce6c5f4e9c9b31b7049bd3396d3",
      "text": "啊……\n这本杂志……也在做恋爱专题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010e629c3a9bb4328c25776a6183b5552ef3f8a838d5a0c5d506d72246451a97",
      "text": "“正式交往前的时期，\n是最开心也最让人心跳加速的”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7a1d0d9e86151fb5b021d6750a5d71af6377dbae56b6fa029d6d21618d88e3e",
      "text": "这个，我以前一起打工的同伴\n也说过差不多的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874bff27ff3d6f3735d9687e377a25875e73fa43d72f3a49269ed89f2fdcc56f",
      "text": "哎，真的吗？\n我记得我同班同学好像也说过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68db8299f186ec7b245c9b602b9c7835c93eebc766009ae56fbd9d57484b66c",
      "text": "大家……都喜欢心跳加速的感觉，吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9303ad98111b7dc25dac08db6ca80f9021a818350d878cae5d49196a14f73f72",
      "text": "呵呵。要是那样的话，女孩子的心脏可真坚强呢。\n……啊，这次再来看看这本女性杂志吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8350f1d3e00e07d652bf1f4525e9209ba88ab3542e9cc3a8fce560ff7cd0555d",
      "text": "（……听说是以“女性视角”和“单相思”为\n主题，本来还在想该怎么办才好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05756f724d4ad04eddd98f0929c53cb72005d4ac62200e7cce05edb7e2d5f24f",
      "text": "（这里的杂志倒是个不错的切入点。\n之后要向帮我们准备的制作人道个谢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cc586147c8f932da840943ac5110ad3a8ff6e41550c3966fd1b892b06611978",
      "text": "……圭先生。\n那边那本杂志上写了什么……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
